_publ_section_synopsis
;
A compound of composition [Cu (C~5~H~7~O~2~)~2~(C~8~H~9~N~3~)] was obtained. In
the crystal, the Cu^II^ ion forms a square-pyramidal geometry with the ligands
(two  acetylacetone and one  2-amino-1-methylbenzimidazole). Hirshfeld surface
analysis was used to investigate the intermolecular interactions.
;
